  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Alt\u0131l\u0131s\u0131\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nBa\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 ve kay\u0131plar\u0131n\u0131
    kolay kabullenebilen biri de\u011Filsin. Baz\u0131 zamanlarda bu reddedi\u015F
    ve mutsuzluk, sende daha \xE7ok ortaya \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor {{isim}}. Yine \xF6yle
    bir d\xF6nemden ge\xE7ti\u011Fini s\xF6yl\xFCyor kart\u0131n. Hayat seni pek
    \xE7ok badire ile belli bir noktaya getirmi\u015F. T\xF6rp\xFClenerek, ac\u0131larla,
    sanc\u0131larla \u015Fekillenmi\u015Fsin. Kaybetti\u011Fini d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    \u015Feylere \u015Fu anki \u015Feklini ve ki\u015Fili\u011Fini bor\xE7lu olsan
    da, i\xE7in pi\u015Fmanl\u0131klarla dolu g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. Art\u0131k eskiye
    s\u0131rt\u0131n\u0131 d\xF6nme zaman\u0131. \u015Eimdiyi ve gelece\u011Fi kaybetmemek
    i\xE7in, ge\xE7mi\u015Fle olan t\xFCm ba\u011Flar\u0131n\u0131 koparmal\u0131s\u0131n.
    Kendin i\xE7in yararl\u0131 olan yollar\u0131 se\xE7ip, o istikamette y\xFCr\xFCmelisin."
